OL,3,ANo risk to public from hoax school bomb
OL,4,Athreats, says government minister
OL,5,
OL,6,FScotland's education secretary has said
OL,7,Fthere is no risk to the public after
OL,8,Fschools across the country were
OL,9,Ftargeted with a fresh wave of hoax bomb
OL,10,Fthreats, less than a month after a
OL,11,Fprevious alert.
OL,13,FAt least 1,000 schools received the
OL,14,Fhoax email, though police and the
OL,15,Fgovernment said there was nothing
OL,16,Fwithin them to suggest a credible
OL,17,Fthreat.
OL,19,FGovernment minister Mairi McAllan told
OL,20,Fparliament the situation was "very much
OL,21,Fin hand".
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
