OL,3,ARussia-Ukraine talks turn to post-war
OL,4,Asecurity but end without breakthrough
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrilateral talks in Abu Dhabi between
OL,7,FRussia, Ukraine and the US aimed at
OL,8,Fending the war in Ukraine have
OL,9,Fconcluded after a second day.
OL,11,FAlthough the American side said they
OL,12,Fsaw "some openings", there was no hint
OL,13,Fof any breakthroughs to end the nearly
OL,14,Ffive year-long war sparked by Russia's
OL,15,Finvasion.
OL,17,FDavyd Arakhamia from Ukraine's
OL,18,Fnegotiating team said that this round
OL,19,Fof talks - the first since February -
OL,20,F"was one of the hardest."
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
