OL,3,ARussia-Ukraine talks turn to post-war
OL,4,Asecurity but end without breakthrough
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I believe the Russians came with very
OL,7,Fstrict directives, so it was extremely
OL,8,Fdifficult to soften the discussion," he
OL,9,Fsaid. But he added that he felt "good
OL,10,Fmomentum" and urged for a second round
OL,11,Fof talks to be organised as soon as
OL,12,Fpossible.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
